   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Rooftop Vegetation</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Rooftop Vegetation Structure and Perception\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original images: four computer-simulated views of the same concrete rooftop of a 15-storey commercial building in central Seoul, with no vegetation (control, 0% green), grass with a walking deck (G, 30%), grass and shrubs (GS, 50%) and grass, shrubs and trees (GST, 70%); buildings in the background are identical. Participants see the four images in random order, each for 90 s with a 30 s blank screen in between, and after each image rate it on the paper's four semantic-differential items on a 7-point scale: natural - artificial, open - closed, attractive - unattractive and comfortable - uncomfortable (stored so that 7 = natural / open / attractive / comfortable). Age and gender are asked at the end. Rebuilt from Lee, Kang, Lee & Lee (2022), Effects of Vegetation Structure on Psychological Restoration in an Urban Rooftop Space, International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health 20(1): 260, with the images cropped from its Figure 1 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: control, G, GS, GST. Analysis as in the paper: one-way ANOVA with Scheffé post hoc tests across the four images for each SD item; the paper (15 young men) found GS and GST rated significantly more natural, attractive and comfortable than the bare concrete roof, while G did not differ significantly from it. Differences from the original study: (1) online, without the ECG and blood-pressure measures (HRV high frequency, LF/HF, systolic and diastolic pressure); (2) the Korean Profile of Mood States (K-POMS) is not included because the paper does not print its items; (3) the dummy image shown first in the lab is not included because the paper does not provide it; (4) the paper lists the SD pairs but not their left-right order or labels, so the page shows the negative pole on the left and the item wording is ours; (5) the paper's sample was 15 men aged about 24; anyone can take part here and the age and gender questions are ours; (6) the paper does not say whether the SD items were answered after each image or once at the end; they are asked after each image here.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"rooftops\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"images\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"sd\",\n      \"title\": \"How would you describe this rooftop?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rows\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"natural\",\n        \"text\": \"Artificial - Natural\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"open\",\n        \"text\": \"Closed - Open\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"attractive\",\n        \"text\": \"Unattractive - Attractive\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"comfortable\",\n        \"text\": \"Uncomfortable - Comfortable\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"text\": \"6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 7,\n        \"text\": \"7\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Semantic differential, 7-point; 1 = artificial / closed / unattractive / uncomfortable, 7 = natural / open / attractive / comfortable. Keyed by image id (control, G, GS, GST).\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"How old are you?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 110\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"rooftop-veg-original\">{\"source\": \"Lee, Kang, Lee & Lee (2022) IJERPH 20(1): 260\", \"n\": 15, \"participants\": \"15 male adults, mean age 23.7 (SD 1.7)\", \"design\": \"within subjects, 4 images in random order, 90 s each, 30 s blank between, dummy image first\", \"green_volume\": {\"control\": 0, \"G\": 0.3, \"GS\": 0.5, \"GST\": 0.7}, \"results\": {\"sd\": \"GS and GST significantly higher than control on naturalness, attractiveness and comfort; G not significantly different from control\", \"HF\": {\"control\": 327.4, \"GS\": 615.5}, \"SBP\": {\"control\": 134.0, \"GS\": 119.5, \"GST\": 121.1}}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eef2ec;--card:#fff;--ink:#1c241d;--muted:#59645a;--accent:#3d6b2f;--line:#d6ded3;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e3efdc}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.ins{color:var(--ink)}\n.view{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#111;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:5;gap:12px}\n.view img{width:100vw;height:auto;max-height:88vh;object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.view .t{color:#999;font-size:.85rem;min-height:1.2em}\n.pic img{width:100%;max-height:40vh;object-fit:contain;display:block;border-radius:8px;background:#ddd}\n.it{padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:4px}\n.it .o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:3px}\n.it label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:3px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.it label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--ink)}\n.it input{margin:0 0 1px}\n.it.miss .o{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.f{margin-top:16px}.f:first-child{margin-top:0}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:110px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Images: Lee, Kang, Lee &amp; Lee (2022), IJERPH 20(1): 260, Figure 1 (doi:10.3390/ijerph20010260, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='rooftop-veg:state', T={view:window.__VIEWMS||90000,blank:window.__VIEWMS?20:30000};\n  var IDS=['control','G','GS','GST'];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function val(name){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+name+'\"]:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));var t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(IDS),k:0,phase:'view'};}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Rooftop spaces</h1><p>You will see four pictures of a city rooftop, one at a time. Look at each picture for a minute and a half and imagine being there; the page moves on by itself. After each picture you describe it with four word pairs, and a 30-second pause follows before the next one. It takes about 10 minutes.</p><div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='trial';st.phase='view';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function timer(ms,label,done){var end=Date.now()+ms,tm=document.getElementById('tm');(function tick(){var s=Math.ceil((end-Date.now())/1000);if(s<=0)return done();if(tm)tm.textContent=label(s);setTimeout(tick,250);})();}\n  function trial(){\n    if(st.k>=st.order.length){st.step='about';save();return route();}\n    var id=st.order[st.k],v=document.createElement('div');v.className='view';app.innerHTML='';app.appendChild(v);\n    if(st.phase==='q')return ask();\n    if(st.phase==='blank'){v.innerHTML='<div class=\"t\" id=\"tm\"></div>';if(st.k+0<st.order.length){var p=new Image();p.src=files[st.order[st.k]].url;}return timer(T.blank,function(s){return 'Next picture in '+s+' s';},function(){st.phase='view';save();route();});}\n    v.innerHTML='<img alt=\"Rooftop\" src=\"'+esc(files[id].url)+'\"><div class=\"t\" id=\"tm\"></div>';\n    timer(T.view,function(s){return 'Picture '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+' · '+s+' s';},function(){st.phase='q';save();route();});\n  }\n  function ask(){\n    var id=st.order[st.k],f=files[id],q=Q.sd;\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Picture '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"The rooftop you just saw\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><div class=\"card\"><p class=\"ins\" style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">'+esc(q.title)+' For each pair, choose the point that fits best.</p>'+(q.rows||[]).map(function(r){var p=String(r.text).split(' - '),nm='sd__'+r.value;return '<div class=\"it\" data-n=\"'+nm+'\"><div class=\"an\"><span>'+esc(p[0])+'</span><span>'+esc(p[1])+'</span></div><div class=\"o\">'+(q.columns||[]).map(function(c){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+nm+'\" value=\"'+c.value+'\">'+c.value+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div></div>';}).join('')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Next</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var out={},miss=0,first=null;\n      (q.rows||[]).forEach(function(r){var nm='sd__'+r.value,x=val(nm),el=app.querySelector('.it[data-n=\"'+nm+'\"]');if(x==null){miss++;el.classList.add('miss');if(!first)first=el;}else{el.classList.remove('miss');out[r.value]=Number(x);}});\n      if(miss){if(first)first.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please answer every pair ('+miss+' missing).');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('sd',out,{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.k++;st.phase=st.k<st.order.length?'blank':'view';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q.age.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"number\" id=\"age\" min=\"16\" max=\"110\"></div><div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q.gender.title)+'</b>'+(Q.gender.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Finish</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var age=Number(document.getElementById('age').value),g=val('gender');if(!(age>=16&&age<=110))return err('Please enter your age.');if(!g)return err('Please choose your gender.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('age',age),SPSite.answer('gender',g)],this,function(){st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  app.addEventListener('change',function(e){var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.it');if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.it.miss'))err('');}});\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='trial')return trial();if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','sd','age','gender'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('rooftops')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+need.join(', ')+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"rooftops\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
